    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;<i>Cyberpunk: Shadow of Ethereal City</i>&quot;</strong> is a 2.5D platformer stealth RPG set in the futuristic metropolis of <strong>Ethereal City</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/extras/0c7d84e6f511a9cd5d9eb645c417cb50.avif?t=1742401956\" data-has-big width=800 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of <strong>HC999</strong>, a former bionic worker designed to recover the special energy known as <i><strong>GhostDrive</strong></i>. To avoid being reclaimed and destroyed by the corporation, HC999 must fight for survival while repairing their own body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/extras/6f9ad41220bcc2f3d2f675754c28f2f4.avif?t=1742401956\" width=298 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uniquely blends <strong>stealth mechanics with dice rolls</strong>\u2014when performing actions such as assassinations, hacking, or movement, the outcome is partially influenced by the dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/extras/cfe3ad0f9518440b2c620c9c04617732.avif?t=1742401956\" width=664 height=664 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use nanotechnology to enter the souls of others and experience juicy burger patties with spicy crawfish flavored staff meals.<br>(English localization of the game coming soon)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/extras/006737f91199d40056cf32f239daa71b.avif?t=1742401956\" data-has-big width=800 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/extras/80dada86792b6527f4e32c17cbece758.avif?t=1742401956\" data-has-big width=800 height=426 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/extras/89bfd9d59f234be2d565af8d6496a8be.avif?t=1742401956\" data-has-big width=800 height=416 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/extras/bf34d9682340bda0696011e2b628fbc1.webp?t=1742401956\" width=32 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;<i>Cyberpunk: Shadow of Ethereal City</i>&quot;</strong> is a 2.5D platformer stealth RPG set in the futuristic metropolis of <strong>Ethereal City</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/extras/0c7d84e6f511a9cd5d9eb645c417cb50.avif?t=1742401956\" data-has-big width=800 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of <strong>HC999</strong>, a former bionic worker designed to recover the special energy known as <i><strong>GhostDrive</strong></i>. To avoid being reclaimed and destroyed by the corporation, HC999 must fight for survival while repairing their own body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/extras/6f9ad41220bcc2f3d2f675754c28f2f4.avif?t=1742401956\" width=298 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uniquely blends <strong>stealth mechanics with dice rolls</strong>\u2014when performing actions such as assassinations, hacking, or movement, the outcome is partially influenced by the dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/extras/cfe3ad0f9518440b2c620c9c04617732.avif?t=1742401956\" width=664 height=664 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use nanotechnology to enter the souls of others and experience juicy burger patties with spicy crawfish flavored staff meals.<br>(English localization of the game coming soon)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/extras/006737f91199d40056cf32f239daa71b.avif?t=1742401956\" data-has-big width=800 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/extras/80dada86792b6527f4e32c17cbece758.avif?t=1742401956\" data-has-big width=800 height=426 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/extras/89bfd9d59f234be2d565af8d6496a8be.avif?t=1742401956\" data-has-big width=800 height=416 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/extras/bf34d9682340bda0696011e2b628fbc1.webp?t=1742401956\" width=32 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
